@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Optional circuit breaker state machine
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

[*] --> Closed
Closed --> Open : selected failure/admission policy trips
Open --> HalfOpen : selected observation condition permits probe
HalfOpen --> Closed : safe probe confirms usable capability
HalfOpen --> Open : probe fails or remains inconclusive
Closed --> Closed : permitted calls within budget
note right of HalfOpen
 Probe must be actually supported and safe.
 No send/deploy as an invented health check.
 Thresholds and durations are unselected.
end note

@enduml
